---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout
  title="About — Matdo"
  description="The story behind Matdo — a name from Cantonese meaning 'everything' — and our mission: less admin, more teaching."
>
  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap" style="max-width:820px">
      <span class="eyebrow">About</span>
      <h1>About Matdo</h1>
      <p class="lede">Matdo makes simple, reliable, affordable tools for the people who teach.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- MISSION -->
  <section class="section-pad band-cream2">
    <div class="wrap mission-wrap reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Our mission</span>
      <h2 class="mission-line">Less admin. More teaching.</h2>
      <p>Every hour spent on paperwork is an hour not spent with a student. We build focused, unfussy apps that handle the busywork and then get out of the way — so caring adults can stay present with the people in front of them. No bloat, no lock-in, no fuss — just tools that quietly earn their keep.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- THE LOGO -->
  <section class="section-pad band-cream2">
    <div class="wrap logo-sec reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">The logo</span>
      <h2>What does the logo mean?</h2>
      <p>The Matdo logo is built from the letters <strong>M</strong> and <strong>D</strong>, stacked vertically into a mark that's simple, modern, and quietly playful. The upper M reads as two small hands reaching out; the lower D opens into a pocket. Together they suggest a little assistant, always ready with whatever tool the moment calls for. Recognize the pocket? It's a nod to a certain blue robot cat — and to the same promise: reach in, and the right thing is already there.</p>
      <div class="logo-row">
        <figure class="logo-card">
          <img src="/logos/matdo.svg" alt="Matdo logo" width="140" height="140" loading="lazy" />
          <figcaption>Matdo</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="logo-card">
          <img src="/logos/matdo-check.svg" alt="Matdo Check logo" width="140" height="140" loading="lazy" />
          <figcaption>Matdo Check</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="logo-card">
          <img src="/logos/matdo-grade.svg" alt="Matdo Grade logo" width="140" height="140" loading="lazy" />
          <figcaption>Matdo Grade</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- THE NAME -->
  <section class="section-pad">
    <div class="wrap name-sec">
      <div class="name-badge reveal">
        <span class="mat-cn" lang="zh-HK">乜都</span>
        <span class="mat-say">“Mut&nbsp;Dou”</span>
        <span class="mat-mean">everything</span>
      </div>
      <div class="name-body reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">The name</span>
        <h2>Matdo means “everything.”</h2>
        <p>“Matdo” has an Eastern origin. It comes from Cantonese — <span lang="zh-HK">乜都</span>, pronounced <strong>Mut&nbsp;Dou</strong> — the everyday word for <em>everything</em>, anything, all of it.</p>
        <p>That's the idea behind our apps: quietly take care of all the routine <em>everything</em> — the sign-ins, the roll calls, the grading — so the people who teach can spend their time on what actually matters.</p>
        <p>Matdo is a growing family of tools for educators. <a href="/check">Matdo&nbsp;Check</a> handles check-in and attendance today, and <strong>Matdo&nbsp;Grade</strong>, our AI homework-grading app, is coming soon. Every Matdo app shares the same promise — <strong>simple, fast, reliable, private, and affordable</strong>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-hero { padding: 150px 0 60px; }
  .page-hero h1 { font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 3.8rem); margin: 1rem 0 1.1rem; }
  .page-hero .lede { font-size: 1.18rem; color: #3d4b47; max-width: 40rem; }

  /* The logo */
  .logo-sec { max-width: 780px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; }
  .logo-sec h2 { font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 3.6vw, 2.7rem); margin: 0.8rem 0 1rem; }
  .logo-sec p { color: #3d4b47; font-size: 1.08rem; line-height: 1.7; text-align: left; }
  .logo-sec strong { color: var(--color-forest); font-weight: 600; }
  .logo-row { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 28px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 2.4rem; }
  .logo-card {
    background: #fff; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 28px 24px 20px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg); display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;
    gap: 12px; width: 200px; margin: 0; transition: transform 0.2s;
  }
  .logo-card:hover { transform: translateY(-6px); }
  .logo-card img { width: 100px; height: 100px; }
  .logo-card figcaption { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-forest); font-size: 1.05rem; }

  /* The name */
  .name-sec { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 0.85fr 1.15fr; gap: 56px; align-items: center; }
  .name-badge { background: linear-gradient(160deg, var(--color-forest), var(--color-teal)); color: #fff; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 44px 28px; text-align: center; box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg); display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
  .mat-cn { font-size: 4.6rem; line-height: 1; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
  .mat-say { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-mint); margin-top: 8px; }
  .mat-mean { font-size: 0.95rem; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.7); font-weight: 600; }
  .name-body h2 { font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 3.6vw, 2.7rem); margin: 0.8rem 0 1rem; }
  .name-body p { color: #3d4b47; font-size: 1.08rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .name-body p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .name-body em { font-style: italic; color: var(--color-forest); }
  .name-body strong { color: var(--color-forest); font-weight: 600; }
  .name-body a { color: var(--color-teal); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }

  /* Mission */
  .mission-wrap { max-width: 780px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; }
  .mission-line { font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.4rem); margin: 1rem 0 1.2rem; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .mission-wrap p { color: #3d4b47; font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 1.7; }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .page-hero { padding: 120px 0 44px; }
    .name-sec { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 30px; }
    .mat-cn { font-size: 3.8rem; }
  }
</style>
